      "start_seconds": 1.18,
      "end_seconds": 4.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.48,
      "end_seconds": 9.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "no problem at all, come in what's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.86,
      "end_seconds": 17.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "Mainly aching all over. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.2,
      "end_seconds": 21.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.78,
      "end_seconds": 28.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "About four days, I think... sorry, two days, I got that wrong."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.29,
      "end_seconds": 38.99,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.8,
      "end_seconds": 52.49,
      "duration_seconds": 12.69,
      "text": "I'd give it a seven, um, out of ten. It settles a little with heat. I had tender spots before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.41,
      "end_seconds": 54.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "how about fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.23,
      "end_seconds": 58.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "No, uh, none, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.55,
      "end_seconds": 63.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "any weight loss, rash or joint swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.91,
      "end_seconds": 68.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "no, I haven't had any of them"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.23,
      "end_seconds": 73.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.77,
      "end_seconds": 78.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.28,
      "end_seconds": 82.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.33,
      "end_seconds": 84.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "I have asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.69,
      "end_seconds": 94.37,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "okay, I can see asthma in your file as well. Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.83,
      "end_seconds": 103.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Diclofenac. I come out in... well, wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.21,
      "end_seconds": 121.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Right, can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.76,
      "end_seconds": 125.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "I'm on paracetamol, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.02,
      "end_seconds": 128.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.66,
      "end_seconds": 129.62,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "1 gram."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.14,
      "end_seconds": 147.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.8,
      "end_seconds": 152.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.51,
      "end_seconds": 155.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.61,
      "end_seconds": 160.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.34,
      "end_seconds": 164.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.79,
      "end_seconds": 170.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "just keyhole surgery on my gallbladder, two years back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 186.16,
      "end_seconds": 198.93,
      "duration_seconds": 12.77,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier weight 70 kilos, height 152 centimetres, SpO2 99 percent on room air temperature is 36.8 degrees, pressure 110 over 69, pulse 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.63,
      "end_seconds": 200.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.29,
      "end_seconds": 205.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.45,
      "end_seconds": 207.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "okay, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.38,
      "end_seconds": 210.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.3,
      "end_seconds": 226.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "Your joints are not swollen and you are tender over many muscle points."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.09,
      "end_seconds": 243.34,
      "duration_seconds": 12.25,
      "text": "good, you can sit up again okay, so my impression is this: I'd lean towards fibromyalgia we shouldn't forget polymyalgia let's get blood tests, for widespread pain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.34,
      "end_seconds": 250.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "When would that take place?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.35,
      "end_seconds": 278.59,
      "duration_seconds": 26.24,
      "text": "you'll be taking amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, long term that should help with pain and sleep gentle graded exercise such as swimming helps more than rest let's get you seen by the pain clinic, I'll arrange the letter come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse please come and see me in six weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.05,
      "end_seconds": 285.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "I'll note it it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.36,
      "end_seconds": 295.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.74,
      "end_seconds": 298.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.39,
      "end_seconds": 301.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "see you soon"
    }
  ]
